Caches: `research/data/adaptive_scalper/`, `research/data/htf/`, `research/data/d1/`. Artifacts: `research/results/`, `research/results_htf/`, `research/results_grid/`, `research/results_d1/`. Docker service name is leftover `btc-eth-hedge`. Live `data/` holds only `events.csv` and `dca_bot_state.json`.

Operational constraints live in `AGENTS.md`. Do not log keys, signatures, or signed URLs.
